{"id":"n15993-2-8","stage":2,"title":"멎다 · 停","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15993-2-8-1","ko":"정말 비가 멎을 때까지 여기서 있게?","zh":"真的要在这里待到雨停吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"멎을","meaning":"停","explanation":"멎다：停；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"멎다","audio":"/audio/1bc743f47838075ff557.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15993","senseId":"2","lemma":"멎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멎을","audio":"/audio/91057e5de2b1e24ca321.mp3"}},{"text":"때까지","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때까지","audio":"/audio/f9e40b9aef43db9d3a5c.mp3"}},{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"있게?","meaning":"待着","explanation":"있다：待着；게：结合语境表示劝告、目的或反问等，常用于非敬语交谈。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있게","audio":"/audio/d5f1c5fe3bed602d0c3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"1bc743f47838075f","term":"멎다","zh":"停","audio":"/audio/1bc743f47838075ff557.mp3","entryId":"15993","definition":"雨或雪等已然止住。","pronunciation":["먿따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"待着","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物停留在某处，不离开。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/64a0957371ef7d010ed0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15993-2-8-2","ko":"응, 나 우산을 안 가지고 왔거든.","zh":"嗯，我没带伞啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"우산을","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우산을","audio":"/audio/21bd32506dc8d1c0fce2.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"가지다：持，带，戴；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"왔거든.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔거든","audio":"/audio/5f43a9b5a9761c33d5e4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99